      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Edvora recovery and incidents — inactive until integration\n/api/automation/recovery/sweep releases expired unstarted claims; expired authorized/uncertain attempts go to review. Only the latest definitive retryable failure may requeue, with exponential backoff and at most three retries. Successful channels never resend. Payment/SMS claims have persisted leases.\n/api/automation/incidents deduplicates incident keys and queues alerts only to active administrators with stored private consented contacts. WF05 failures force record-only even when the caller omits that flag.\nKeep the workflow unpublished until backend/provider integration is complete. Bind it as the Edvora error workflow after publication is authorized. Do not alter Nestly workflows or credentials.",
        "color": 5
      }
    }
